      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER FAIR (1) is the horse to beat after turning two close finishes into a barnstorming win here last time. Keeps Philpot's 3kg claim and should appreciate the extra 200m. Can make it two on the bounce. POWER OF SUCCESS (5) brings strong country form and looms a major threat. Didn't give his rivals a sniff last time at Dalby when leading pillar-to-post. Gets in light with Youngberry's claim and if they push forward again he will prove hard to reel in. ICONIFY (4) had excuses at the start before going under narrowly to SUPER FAIR here and has a genuine case if the extra trip is within range. AYASAKI (6) drops back from Saturday company after a close Eagle Farm second. At his top now and will inject a bit of pace into the race. Deserves respect.",
